</td></tr></table>

\subsection StructuredExampleHarmonicOscillator The 2-D quantum harmonic oscillator

A separable Hamiltonian \f$ H_x \oplus H_y \f$ has the pairwise sums of the 1-D energies as its spectrum, which
\ref KroneckerSum::eigenvalues returns without forming the 2-D matrix [7].

