\subsection StructuredExampleImpurity An impurity bound state

A localized perturbation of a diagonal band Hamiltonian is a rank-one update, the Koster-Slater model [8]. \ref DPR1EigenSolver finds the whole
spectrum in \f$ O(N^2) \f$ from the secular equation [9], including the bound state that splits off below the band.

